# Project overview

Multi-tenant ecosystem builder (Entity System / ESP): schema-driven entities, auto-generated CRUD, RBAC, dynamic UI, optional modules, hooks, and a Vertex AI stack.

## Monorepo layout

```
apps/
  api/                 Fastify HTTP API
  web/                 React Router 7 SPA
  platform/            defineApp bootstrap (modules: [] by default)
  worker-service/      AI jobs, hooks, Gmail, document extraction
  worker-aggregation/  Aggregation pipeline
  worker-indexer/      Search / index worker
packages/              Shared libraries (@repo/*)
modules/               Optional compile-time extension modules
docs/                  guides/, reference/, ai-platform/, infrastructure/, ui-design-manual/
.local/                Tenant data only (not main codebase)
```

## Stack (short)

| Layer | Tech |
|-------|------|
| Web | React 19, React Router 7, TanStack Query, Tailwind 4, `@repo/ui` |
| API | Fastify 5, Zod 4, Firebase Auth + App Check |
| Data | Firestore Native, GCS, `@repo/firestore-converters` + `@repo/gcp-firebase` |
| Async | Cloud Tasks, Cloud Scheduler, Pub/Sub, `@repo/workload-registry` |
| AI | Vertex AI via `@repo/ai-engine` (`runAiRequest` only) |
| Infra | Cloud Run, Terraform, WIF, Secret Manager |
| Tooling | pnpm catalog:strict, turbo, Vitest, Cypress |

## Request lifecycle (typical)

```text
Web (RR7 + TanStack Query)
  → HTTP + Bearer + App Check
API (auth → RBAC → CRUD / enqueue)
  → Firestore under tenants/{tenantId}/…
  → Cloud Tasks (or localDispatch) → worker-service
```

All generative / embedding model calls go through `runAiRequest` in `@repo/ai-engine` and are recorded on `ai_jobs`.

