## Non-negotiables (pointers)

- Tenant **data** lives under `.local/` only — see `03-tenant-isolation`.
- Docs live under the taxonomy in `04-docs-taxonomy`; enforced by `pnpm check:docs-layout`.
- Async work must register in `@repo/workload-registry` — see `60-workload-registry` and `AGENTS.md`.
- Before merge, keep `pnpm validate:local` green — see `02-validation-gate`.

